            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.0.5</h3>
<ul>
<li>Resize the sidebar by dragging the gap next to it. Drag all the way left to hide it; double-click to reset.</li>
<li>With the sidebar hidden, the page now has a thin, Dia-like frame.</li>
<li>Updates now show up the moment they're published.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
